 "remarks": "Come home to an elegant, sophisticated, New York styled, One Bedroom/One Bath unit on an upper floor with fabulous city and water views. Beautifully re-styled unit includes: Living Room with engineered flooring, brand new windows, sliders to over-sized Balcony, generous Dining Area with new light fixture, Exquisite Kitchen with custom cabinetry, new light fixture; Newly carpeted Bedroom, new windows, incredible walk-in Closet w/Safe. Bathroom with Tumbled marble and large, stall shower; plenty of closet space. Unit includes one assigned/indoor garage parking; heat/hot water & central air included in monthly common fees; 24/7 front door/desk personnel, Common Laundry Area on C Level with new machines, Health & Fitness Center ($15.00 a month). Community room + Outdoor rear (approximately 2,000 sq ft). Deck with BBQ/Tables/Umbrellas/Chairs. Enclosed/Private Individual storage. Additional indoor and outdoor parking available at monthly rates. Located in Mid-City Stamford near restaurants/library/movie theaters, park & markets. Assessment: $295.00 a month to 01/31/2027. This is a one-of-a-kind unit in this popular Stamford high rise.",
